  "english": {
    "僕の時価総額400円の心臓と": "My heart, worth four hundred yen at market value,",
    "絵に描いたような君の綺麗な心臓を": "and your beautiful heart, as though it were painted—",
    "合わせてできたしわの数が": "the wrinkles formed when we bring them together",
    "僕達の未来の価値だ": "are what our future is worth.",
    "残された時間が少ないのなら": "If we have little time left,",
    "崩れてく時間が増えてくのなら": "if more of our time is falling apart,",
    "零さないようにあわせて": "bring them together, so none of it spills away.",
    "変わらない": "It will not change.",
    "変われないよ 僕ら": "We cannot change.",
    "今もしっかり握っている": "Even now, we hold on tightly.",
    "ちぎれない": "It will not tear apart.",
    "ちぎらないよ 僕ら": "We will not tear it apart.",
    "今もしっかり繋いでる手": "Our hands are still joined tightly.",
    "僕の一生分なり続けている心拍と": "The heartbeat that has kept sounding throughout my life,",
    "透き通るような君の綺麗な一拍を": "and your one beautiful, almost transparent beat—",
    "合わせてできた波の数だけ": "with every wave they made together,",
    "僕達は揺らめきあってた": "we swayed together.",
    "過ぎていく時が早すぎるのなら": "If time is passing far too quickly,",
    "有り余る隙間が悲しいのなら": "if all this space left over makes us sad,",
    "今もしっかり繋いでる": "Even now, we are holding on tightly.",
    "重なるひびを僕達は": "These days and cracks that overlap—",
    "流るるひびも僕達は": "and these days that flow away—",
    "思い出すこともなくなって": "perhaps we will stop even remembering them,",
    "しまうんだろう": "perhaps that is what will happen.",
    "しまうんだろうって": "I think that may be what will happen.",
    "そんな": "In that kind of",
    "しわあわせで": "happiness, with our wrinkles joined,",
    "溢れ出す願い込めて僕らは": "filled with wishes overflowing, we",
    "今から君の見てる方へと": "will head toward wherever you are looking, starting now.",
    "やるせない夢が覚めた頃に": "When we have awakened from this helpless dream,",
    "また、しわをあわせて": "let us bring our wrinkles together again."
  }
